    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase D CPU baseline benchmarks for GPU break-even Category A kernels. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Category A covers distance and Top-K style kernels that require &gt;= 1.5x GPU speedup before the optional GPU path can be enabled. This benchmark records deterministic CPU reference timings only; final GPU comparison remains gated on 2027 hardware availability. </para>
